    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a small coat worn by men beneath the doublet; also a short coat worn as armor (OED s.v. petticoat n. (a.) 1 a), here made of silk | a small coat worn by men beneath the doublet; also a short coat worn as armor (OED s.v. petticoat n. (a.) 1 a) | of wulle made of wool | a small coat worn by men beneath the doublet; also a short coat worn as armor (OED s.v. petticoat n. (a.) 1 a), here made of cotton | a small coat worn by men beneath the doublet; also a short coat worn as armor (OED s.v. petticoat n. (a.) 1 a) | a small coat worn by men beneath the doublet; also a short coat worn as armor (OED s.v. petticoat n. (a.) 1 a), here knitted</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
